  "扫描考察中的原始照片：人物、庭院、通道、屋顶轮廓与材料细节。": "Original photographs from the scanning visit: people, courtyards, passages, rooflines and material details.",
  "田野调查 / 建筑 / 表面": "FIELDWORK / ARCHITECTURE / SURFACES",
  "记录龙门寺外部空间时，我们使用索尼相机采集三维扫描与空间记录所需的影像，覆盖建筑及周边环境。通过记录建筑结构、屋顶细节、石阶与自然景观，逐步建立外部空间的三维模型，为后续数字重建、古建保护与虚拟环境呈现提供数据。": "During the digital documentation of Longmen Temple’s exterior spaces, we used a Sony α7S IV camera to capture imagery for 3D scanning and spatial data collection, documenting the temple’s architecture and its surrounding environment. By capturing architectural structures, roof details, stone stairways, and the surrounding natural landscape, we gradually developed a digital 3D model of the temple’s exterior. This process provides essential data for subsequent 3D reconstruction, digital preservation of historic architecture, and virtual environment visualization.",
  "从全景影像中提取屋顶信息，并补充近距离照片，记录更精细的建筑特征。": "Roof details were extracted from 360° imagery, supplemented by close-up photographs captured with a Sony α7S IV camera to document finer architectural features.",
  "通过影像扫描记录树木的形态与结构，为后续三维重建提供依据。": "Trees within the space were digitally scanned using a camera to capture their forms and structural details for subsequent 3D reconstruction.",
  "大雄宝殿是龙门寺数字记录的重点。我们从不同角度和距离拍摄建筑外部，重点记录屋檐、斗拱、立柱、门窗与表面纹理，为完整呈现建筑形态与细节提供参考。": "As the main hall of Longmen Temple, the Mahavira Hall served as a key focus of our digital documentation process, particularly in terms of its architectural structure, roof configuration, and exterior details. To achieve a faithful digital reconstruction, we used a high-resolution camera to capture detailed images of the hall’s exterior from multiple angles and distances, focusing on its roof eaves, traditional bracket structures, columns, doors, windows, and surface textures.",
  "同时，以全景摄影记录大殿与周围庭院的整体布局，保存建筑尺度、位置及其与环境的空间关系。结合高清建筑照片与全景影像，使三维模型兼顾细节和整体空间的连贯性，为建筑细部修复与沉浸式虚拟环境提供依据。": "In parallel, 360° panoramic photography was employed to document the overall spatial layout of the hall and its surrounding courtyard, providing a comprehensive reference for the building’s scale, positioning, and spatial relationships with its environment. By integrating high-resolution architectural photographs with panoramic imagery, we aimed to achieve both detailed architectural representation and spatial coherence in the 3D modeling process. This combined approach provided essential visual references and supporting data for subsequent digital reconstruction, architectural detail restoration, and the development of immersive virtual environments.",
  "为补充地面摄影与全景影像，我们利用无人机从上方记录屋顶。建筑高度、拍摄角度和周边环境限制了地面视角，航拍则补足屋顶整体结构与建筑细部。": "To further improve the 3D digital reconstruction of the Longmen Temple, we employed drone-based aerial photography to capture the roof from an overhead perspective, complementing ground-level photography and 360° panoramic imaging. Due to limitations in building height, shooting angles, and surrounding environmental conditions, conventional ground-level photography could not fully capture the roof's overall structure and architectural details.",
