  "[ 研究背景 / 观音堂 ]": "[ RESEARCH CONTEXT / GUANYIN HALL ]",
  "如何通过数字记录，同时呈现彩塑的细节与它在层叠殿堂中的空间关系？研究在近距离采集、空间记录与实时呈现之间展开。": "How can a digital record communicate both the detail of a painted sculpture and its place within a densely layered interior? The study moves between close capture, spatial documentation and real-time presentation.",
  "[ 实体 → 表达 ]": "[ MATERIAL → REPRESENTATION ]",
  "两轮扫描与殿堂全景记录，经由扫描文件后处理和实时渲染，形成数字呈现。项目以此探索三教融合的整体关系，并深入观察单体彩塑的细部。": "Two scanning rounds and a 360° hall record lead into scan-file post-processing and Unity3D rendering. The report connects this workflow to two aims: the harmony of three traditions, and the close study of individual painted sculptures.",
  "长治项目 · 现场呈现": "5_page8",
