  "从数字文件到现场": "FROM FILE TO SITE",
  "投影映射测试中，我们先将参考网格投射到墙面和建筑表面。通过观察网格的位置、尺度与畸变，判断数字影像与实体环境之间的对应关系。": "During the projection mapping tests, we first projected a reference grid onto the walls and architectural surfaces of the exhibition space. By examining the position, scale, and distortion of the grid lines, we evaluated the alignment between the digital imagery and the physical environment.",
  "结合墙面尺寸、空间转角和投影机位置，进行几何校正、边缘对齐与透视调整，使影像贴合不同表面，并在空间边界之间保持视觉连续。": "Based on the dimensions of the walls, spatial corners, and projector positions, we then performed geometric correction, edge alignment, and perspective adjustments to ensure that the projected content accurately matched each surface while maintaining visual continuity across spatial boundaries.",
