  "长治项目 · 透明屏展示": "5_page12",
  "在数字展厅中布置半透明投影屏幕，每块屏幕呈现一尊具有代表性的观音堂造像，以高清数字影像展示其独特形态、精细工艺与历史意义。半透明材质形成相互叠加的视觉层次，使造像在展览空间中呈现不同的纵深。": "mi-transparent projection screens arranged throughout the museum's digital gallery. Each screen presents a representative Buddhist sculpture from Guanyin Hall, highlighting its distinctive form, intricate craftsmanship, and historical significance through high-resolution digital imagery. The translucent nature of the screens creates overlapping visual layers, allowing the projected sculptures to appear at different depths within the exhibition space.",
  "观众在装置间行走时，视角变化不断揭示影像之间新的空间关系，使观看成为主动的空间探索。通过数字影像、光与实体展陈设计的结合，以当代沉浸体验重新诠释传统造像，建立文化遗产与当代观众之间的联系。": "As visitors move through the installation, shifting perspectives reveal new spatial relationships between the images, transforming the experience from passive observation into spatial exploration. By integrating digital imagery, light, and physical exhibition design, we aimed to reinterpret traditional Buddhist sculptures through a contemporary immersive experience, creating a more engaging connection between cultural heritage and modern audiences.",
  "长治项目 · 法华罐": "5_page13",
  "长治 / 数字遗产": "CHANGZHI / DIGITAL HERITAGE",
  "项目 05 / 资料来源：长治博物馆项目报告": "PROJECT 05 / SOURCE: CHANGZHI MUSEUM PROJECT REPORT",
  "文物的": "Digital Reconstruction",
  "数字重建": "of Cultural Artifacts",
  "以法华罐为例": "A Case Study of the Fahua Jar",
  "长治项目 · 法华罐重建流程": "5_page14",
  "[ 过程 ]": "[ PROCESS ] ;",
  "01 / 扫描采集": "01 / SCANING",
  "首先对法华罐进行全方位影像采集，并对浮雕、镂空雕刻与装饰纹样补充高清扫描。通过相机对齐、点云重建和网格生成，建立初步三维模型，为后续细节完善与纹理恢复提供基础。": "We first conducted 360° image capture of the Fahua Jar, supplemented by high-resolution scans of intricate reliefs, openwork carvings, and decorative patterns. Through camera alignment, point cloud reconstruction, and mesh generation, we developed an initial 3D model, providing a foundation for further detail refinement and texture restoration.",
  "02 / 细节修补": "02 / DETAIL REPAIRING",
  "03 / 纹样重绘": "03 / PATTERN REDRAWING",
  "针对罐口和底部的几何缺失与结构瑕疵，修补并完善初始模型。通过网格重建生成连续的三角网格，改善几何完整性与表面细节，为后续纹理映射和高精度数字重建做准备。": "To address missing geometry and structural imperfections around the jar's rim and base, we repaired and refined the initial 3D model. Mesh reconstruction algorithms were then applied to generate a continuous triangular mesh, improving geometric completeness and surface details for subsequent texture mapping and high-fidelity digital reconstruction.",
  "基于修复后的三维模型，数字描摹装饰纹样，并沿轮廓制作线条动画。通过控制笔画的顺序、运动与光效，使纹样逐渐浮现于三维表面，凸显器物的雕塑细节与艺术特征。": "Based on the restored 3D model of the Fahua Jar, we digitally traced its decorative patterns and created animated line-drawing effects along their contours. By controlling the sequence, movement, and lighting effects of the animated strokes, the intricate patterns gradually emerge across the 3D surface, highlighting the artifact's sculptural details and artistic characteristics while enhancing its digital presentation.",
  "长治项目 · 粒子重建流程": "5_page16",
